    "One-second buckets can combine invocations. Bucket quantiles cannot be combined into campaign percentiles.",
    "The campaign separates operations by 1.2 seconds. An operation can still span several wall-clock buckets.",
    "The dataset does not expose run IDs. Timestamp association is an inference.",
    "Worker B uses an asynchronous WebSocket. CPU attribution to its initial invocation is not independently established.",
    "Reported CPU is an analytics observation, not an invoice or total per-signature cost."
  ],
